  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:normal&quot;&gt;The proposed development, by reason of its failure to provide adequate lines of sight for the crossover, swept path analysis to demonstrate satisfactory on-site parking and evidence to justify the new crossover would not result in dangerous movements detrimental to highway safety concerns in close proximity to a corner and the loss of an on-street parking space, would result in an unacceptable impact on highway safety. As such, the development is contrary to policies TR4(1c) and TR6(4) of the National Planning Policy Framework (2026), T4F, T6 and T6.1 of the London Plan (2021) and M2 of the Harrow Local Plan (2021-2041).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
